  "dimensions: runner soft set has 6 terms (B1, B2 x4, B3). The frozen sources disagree: objectives algorithm_spec names 7 (J_rates, J_irregularity, J_synchrony, J_Fano, J_hetero, J_EI, J_CL1C); objectives J entries list 6 (J_Fano_J_hetero combined). Sources: manifests/agsdr_local_objectives.json algorithm_spec and J entries (OPEN-18)",
