  "overflow: frozen rule keeps N1=8 nondominated survivors with w=1/6 tie-breaker (agsdr_local_harness.json selection). It does not define overflow beyond the front. The front-order fill from dominated fronts is WITHDRAWN as automatic (owner ruling 1 note). Overflow is open (OPEN-18)",
  "time basis: frozen H09 and J_EI are per step (edge_current_trace[t]); runner uses a time-integrated ratio over the 2000 ms run",
  "sign: frozen J_EI takes I_e positive and I_i negative; runner and record take abs(w)",
  "hard list: design line 18 lists nine gates; manifest lists H01-H12. H07 and H11 are not computed by the runner (OPEN-24)"
